    {
      "name": "Primary Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one action: store-blue pill for Contact.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-blue\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"/></svg> Contact</a>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border:0;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font-sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.3,1.2,0.5,1),background-color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);} .ds-pill:active{transform:scale(0.96);} .ds-pill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0a66ff;outline-offset:3px;} .ds-pill-blue{height:46px;padding:0 32px;font-size:17px;background:#0a66ff;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;} .ds-pill-blue:hover{background:#0852cc;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Grey pill with pressed-blue text, beside the primary (Download CV).",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-grey\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/><path d=\"M12 15V3\"/></svg> Download CV</a>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border:0;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font-sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.3,1.2,0.5,1),background-color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);} .ds-pill:active{transform:scale(0.96);} .ds-pill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0a66ff;outline-offset:3px;} .ds-pill-grey{height:46px;padding:0 24px;font-size:17px;background:#f2f2f7;color:#0852cc;text-decoration:none;} .ds-pill-grey:hover{background:#e6e6ee;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "36px round grey stepper for the preview gallery.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next previews\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border:0;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font-sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.3,1.2,0.5,1),background-color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);} .ds-pill:active{transform:scale(0.96);} .ds-pill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0a66ff;outline-offset:3px;} .ds-pill-icon{width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;background:#f2f2f7;color:#0852cc;} .ds-pill-icon:hover{background:#e6e6ee;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-metric",
      "description": "Current marker in blue; metric chip in grey with tabular pressed-blue text.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><span class=\"ds-chip-current\">Current</span><span class=\"ds-chip-metric\">4M+ users</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-chip-current{border-radius:999px;background:#0a66ff;color:#fff;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1;font-weight:700;} .ds-chip-metric{border-radius:999px;background:#f2f2f7;color:#0852cc;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Top Bar",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-link",
      "description": "Translucent bar; gains monogram, name and compact Contact once the header scrolls away.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-bar\"><a class=\"ds-bar-id\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-bar-icon\">HE</span><span>Hosam Elnabawy</span></a><nav class=\"ds-bar-nav\"><a href=\"#\">Preview</a><a href=\"#\">Experience</a><a href=\"#\">Projects</a><a href=\"#\">Stack</a></nav><a class=\"ds-bar-cta\" href=\"#\">Contact</a></header>",
      "css": ".ds-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;height:56px;padding:0 32px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);backdrop-filter:blur(24px);border-bottom:1px solid #d8d8de;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#111114;} .ds-bar-id{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;} .ds-bar-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:22.5%;background:#0a66ff;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;} .ds-bar-nav{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:28px;} .ds-bar-nav a{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#4a4a52;text-decoration:none;transition:color 200ms;} .ds-bar-nav a:hover{color:#111114;} .ds-bar-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-bar-cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0a66ff;outline-offset:3px;border-radius:8px;} .ds-bar-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:32px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#0a66ff;color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);} .ds-bar-cta:hover{background:#0852cc;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fact Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Five hairline-divided cells: uppercase data label, counted tabular numeral, note.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-facts\"><div><dt>Experience</dt><dd class=\"ds-n\">5+</dd><dd class=\"ds-note\">years</dd></div><div><dt>Reach</dt><dd class=\"ds-n\">4M+</dd><dd class=\"ds-note\">users on Najiz</dd></div><div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd class=\"ds-n ds-t\">iOS · Android</dd><dd class=\"ds-note\">and Flutter</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin:0;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid #d8d8de;border-bottom:1px solid #d8d8de;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-facts>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:0 16px;} .ds-facts>div+div{border-left:1px solid #d8d8de;} .ds-facts dt{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b73;} .ds-facts dd{margin:0;} .ds-n{margin-top:4px;height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:38px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#4a4a52;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-t{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;} .ds-note{margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;color:#6b6b73;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Preview Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "preview-panel",
      "description": "Tall full-colour panel: claim, demonstrated figure, caption.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-panel\"><h3>Over 4 million people can meet a judge from their phone.</h3><div class=\"ds-panel-fig\"><p class=\"ds-panel-n\">4M+</p><div class=\"ds-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div><p class=\"ds-panel-cap\">Najiz, Ministry of Justice KSA. Each dot is 100,000 users.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:272px;height:520px;padding:24px;border-radius:32px;background:#0a66ff;color:#fff;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;} .ds-panel h3{margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.14;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;} .ds-panel-fig{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;} .ds-panel-n{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:76px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-dots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:9px;} .ds-dots span{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;transition:transform 600ms cubic-bezier(0.3,1.2,0.5,1);} .ds-panel:hover .ds-dots span{transform:scale(1.08);} .ds-panel-cap{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.375;font-weight:500;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "App Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "app-icon",
      "description": "Project listing: tile-colour squircle icon, title, meta, metric chip, description, tech.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-app\"><span class=\"ds-app-icon\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"/><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"ds-app-body\"><div class=\"ds-app-head\"><div><h3>Sahl</h3><p class=\"ds-app-meta\">Payments app · Client work</p></div><span class=\"ds-app-metric\">+40%</span></div><p class=\"ds-app-desc\">NFC payments made faster by modularising the code architecture.</p><p class=\"ds-app-tech\">Kotlin · Jetpack Compose · NFC</p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-app{display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8d8de;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#111114;max-width:480px;} .ds-app-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:22.5%;background:#0b6b4f;color:#fff;transition:transform 500ms cubic-bezier(0.3,1.2,0.5,1);} .ds-app:hover .ds-app-icon{transform:scale(1.06) rotate(-3deg);} .ds-app-body{flex:1;min-width:0;} .ds-app-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;} .ds-app h3{margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;} .ds-app-meta{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:#6b6b73;} .ds-app-metric{border-radius:999px;background:#f2f2f7;color:#0852cc;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-app-desc{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.625;color:#4a4a52;} .ds-app-tech{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.375;color:#6b6b73;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Information Rows",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Hairline-ruled label/value rows with store-blue links.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-info\"><div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href=\"#\">hello@example.com</a></dd></div><div><dt>Languages</dt><dd>Arabic, English</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-info{margin:0;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:560px;} .ds-info>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8d8de;} .ds-info dt{font-size:15px;color:#6b6b73;} .ds-info dd{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.625;font-weight:500;color:#111114;} .ds-info a{color:#0a66ff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:transparent;text-underline-offset:0.22em;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;transition:text-decoration-color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);} .ds-info a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor;} .ds-info a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0a66ff;outline-offset:3px;border-radius:8px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Store Listing",
    "overview": "The page is an app store product page for a person. A white ground carries grouped grey fields, near-black ink and a single store blue that marks every action. Identity reads the way an app does: a large flat-colour squircle icon, a heavy name, a subtitle, and a pill to act on. Evidence sits in a divided fact strip, a sideways gallery of tall full-colour preview panels, hairline-ruled information rows and a version history.\n\nDensity is calm and listing-like: one centred column, generous section breaks marked by a single hairline, and colour reserved for icons, panels and the one action blue. Depth is tonal (white over grey), not shadowed. Motion follows two curves only, a spring for things that arrive and an exponential ease-out for things that draw, and every animated figure starts from a visible default so nothing is ever blank without JavaScript or with reduced motion.\n\nThe world refuses the dark developer portfolio of a centred hero, glow and equal cards.",
